  characterName: Mwanajuma Hassan
  promptText: "Industrial trawlers are dragging through our nearshore waters, destroying
    the reef that feeds my children\u2019s future. Rallying the village to chase
    them off could mean confrontation with armed crews. Do I lead my community to
    fight for the reef?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, defend the reef; your children need a living sea.
  rightAnswer: No, avoid confrontation for now; keep families safe and seek another
    way.
